# Managed by wifi-provision.
#
# The stock OpenIPC stanza (kept as wlan0.stock) started wpa_supplicant here
# from the U-Boot environment. wifi-manager owns the supplicant, hostapd and
# DHCP on this interface instead, so ifup only has to bring the link up --
# two owners of one radio is a race, and the loser is whichever set of
# credentials the user actually typed in.
#
# To go back to the stock behaviour: move wlan0.stock over this file and
# disable /etc/init.d/S41wifi.
iface wlan0 inet manual
    pre-up ip link set dev wlan0 up
